<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pre-Pedidos Padcolor — Verano 2026 v7</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/xlsx-js-style@1.2.0/dist/xlsx.bundle.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/pdf-lib@1.17.1/dist/pdf-lib.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{
  --pad-blue:#0a3d8f;
  --pad-blue-dark:#062862;
  --pad-blue-light:#e8f1fb;
  --pad-yellow:#f4a800;
  --pad-yellow-light:#fff4d6;
  --pad-green:#1e8e4a;
  --pad-green-light:#e1f4e8;
  --pad-red:#c8302c;
  --pad-red-light:#fde8e7;
  --pad-grey-50:#f7f8fb;
  --pad-grey-100:#f0f2f5;
  --pad-grey-200:#e3e6eb;
  --pad-grey-300:#d0d4db;
  --pad-grey-500:#7c818a;
  --pad-grey-700:#3f434b;
  --pad-text:#1a1f2b;
  --pad-shadow-sm:0 1px 3px rgba(10,30,60,.08);
  --pad-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(10,30,60,.10);
  --pad-shadow-lg:0 6px 24px rgba(10,30,60,.14);
  --radius:10px;
  --radius-sm:6px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html,body{font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:var(--pad-text);background:var(--pad-grey-50);font-size:14px;line-height:1.4}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;color:inherit}
input,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:14px}
a{color:var(--pad-blue);text-decoration:none}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}

/* -------- Header -------- */
header{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200);padding:10px 18px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;box-shadow:var(--pad-shadow-sm)}
.header-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;max-width:1600px;margin:0 auto;flex-wrap:wrap}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;color:var(--pad-blue)}
.logo-mark{width:42px;height:40px;object-fit:contain;display:block}
.logo-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-weight:500;display:block;line-height:1}
.agent-box{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:12.5px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.ag-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.2;min-width:120px}
.ag-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;font-weight:600}
.ag-val{font-weight:600;color:var(--pad-text)}
.ag-empty{color:#9aa1ad;font-style:italic;font-weight:400}

/* -------- Layout -------- */
.main-wrap{max-width:1600px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 460px;gap:14px}
.col-left,.col-right{min-width:0}
.col-right{position:sticky;top:74px;align-self:start;max-height:calc(100vh - 86px);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}

/* -------- Cards / panels -------- */
.panel{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--pad-shadow-sm);border:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200)}
.panel-header{padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200);font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}
.panel-body{padding:14px 16px}

/* -------- Búsqueda y filtros -------- */
.search-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:6px 8px 6px 14px;border:2px solid var(--pad-grey-200);transition:border-color .15s}
.search-bar:focus-within{border-color:var(--pad-blue)}
.search-bar svg{flex:0 0 18px;color:var(--pad-grey-500)}
.search-bar input{flex:1;border:none;outline:none;font-size:15px;padding:8px 0;background:transparent}
.search-clear{font-size:18px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}
.search-clear:hover{background:var(--pad-grey-100)}

.filters-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;align-items:center}
.filter-chip{padding:6px 12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--pad-grey-300);border-radius:99px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--pad-grey-700);cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;transition:all .12s;white-space:nowrap}
.filter-chip:hover{border-color:var(--pad-blue);color:var(--pad-blue)}
.filter-chip.active{background:var(--pad-blue);color:#fff;border-color:var(--pad-blue)}
.filter-chip .qty{background:rgba(0,0,0,.08);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:99px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}
.filter-chip.active .qty{background:rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
.filter-chip.special{border-color:var(--pad-yellow);color:var(--pad-yellow);background:var(--pad-yellow-light)}
.filter-chip.special.active{background:var(--pad-yellow);color:#fff}
.filter-chip.papel{border-color:#7e3df5;color:#7e3df5;background:#f3edff}
.filter-chip.papel.active{background:#7e3df5;color:#fff;border-color:#7e3df5}

.filter-toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 10px;background:var(--pad-grey-100);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--pad-grey-700);cursor:pointer}
.filter-toggle:hover{background:var(--pad-grey-200)}

.filter-toolbar{background:var(--pad-grey-100);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:10px 12px;margin-top:10px;display:none}
.filter-toolbar.open{display:block}
.filter-toolbar-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);margin-bottom:6px}

.results-info{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 4px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-weight:500}
.price-list-banner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#fff8e1;color:#9b6800;border:1.5px solid var(--pad-yellow);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 14px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}
.price-list-banner.ready{background:var(--pad-green-light);color:var(--pad-green);border-color:var(--pad-green)}
.price-list-banner-icon{font-size:16px;font-weight:900;flex:0 0 auto}
.results-count strong{color:var(--pad-text);font-weight:700}

/* -------- Grid productos -------- */
.products-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:6px}
.product-card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200);box-shadow:var(--pad-shadow-sm);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform .12s,box-shadow .12s}
.product-card:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:var(--pad-shadow)}
.product-card.agotado{opacity:.55}
.product-img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;background:var(--pad-grey-100);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-size:12px;text-align:center;padding:6px;position:relative;cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden}
.product-img.has-img{background:#fff;padding:0}
.product-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .25s ease}
.product-img.has-img:hover img{transform:scale(1.04)}
.product-img.no-img{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#f4f5f8,#f4f5f8 8px,#eef0f3 8px,#eef0f3 16px)}
.product-img-page{position:absolute;top:6px;right:6px;background:rgba(10,61,143,.92);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:99px;letter-spacing:.3px}
.product-img-modelo{position:absolute;top:6px;left:6px;background:#fff;color:var(--pad-blue-dark);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:99px;border:1.5px solid var(--pad-blue);box-shadow:var(--pad-shadow-sm)}
.product-tag-e{position:absolute;bottom:6px;left:6px;background:var(--pad-yellow);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:.4px}
.product-tag-nuevo{position:absolute;top:6px;left:6px;background:#e61f70;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:.4px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(230,31,112,.45);transform:rotate(-6deg);text-shadow:0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
.product-body{padding:8px 10px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;flex:1}
.product-code{font-family:'Roboto Mono','Courier New',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2px}
.product-desc{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--pad-text);line-height:1.3;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;min-height:32px}
.product-pack{font-size:11px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-weight:500}
.product-stock{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-top:2px}
.product-stock.in{color:var(--pad-green)}
.product-stock.out{color:var(--pad-red)}
.product-prices{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:6px;margin-top:4px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px dashed var(--pad-grey-200)}
.price-block{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.15}
.price-label{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:600}
.price-value{font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--pad-text)}
.price-paq{color:var(--pad-blue);font-size:14px}
.price-noprice{font-style:italic;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-weight:500;font-size:11.5px}

.product-actions{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
.qty-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:600;margin-right:2px}
.qty-input-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--pad-grey-300);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}
.qty-btn{width:28px;height:30px;background:var(--pad-grey-100);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pad-grey-700);transition:background .12s}
.qty-btn:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--pad-grey-200)}
.qty-btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
.qty-input{width:42px;border:none;outline:none;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;height:30px;-moz-appearance:textfield}
.qty-input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,.qty-input::-webkit-inner-spin-button{-webkit-appearance:none;margin:0}
.btn-add{flex:1;background:var(--pad-blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;height:30px;border-radius:6px;transition:background .12s}
.btn-add:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--pad-blue-dark)}
.btn-add:disabled{background:var(--pad-grey-300);color:var(--pad-grey-500);cursor:not-allowed}
.qty-max-hint{font-size:10px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);margin-top:2px;text-align:center;font-weight:500}

.empty-state{text-align:center;padding:48px 16px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-style:italic}

/* -------- Cart -------- */
.cart-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;min-height:0}
.cart-scroll{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.cart-form{padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200);background:#fff;flex:0 0 auto}
.form-group{margin-bottom:10px}
.form-group label{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pad-grey-700);margin-bottom:3px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}
.form-group label .req{color:var(--pad-red);margin-left:2px}
.form-input{width:100%;padding:8px 10px;border:1.5px solid var(--pad-grey-300);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;background:#fff;transition:border-color .12s}
.form-input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--pad-blue)}
.form-input.readonly{background:var(--pad-grey-100);color:var(--pad-grey-700);cursor:default}
.form-input.error{border-color:var(--pad-red)}
.form-input.success{border-color:var(--pad-green)}
.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
.form-msg{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;margin-top:4px;display:none}
.form-msg.show{display:block}
.form-msg.error{color:var(--pad-red)}
.form-msg.success{color:var(--pad-green)}

/* Bloque que aparece SOLO cuando el pedido excede el crédito disponible.
   Vive dentro del cart-scroll, al final de la lista de productos.
   Reúne mensaje motivacional, cifras (línea / disponible) y CTA de aumento,
   todo en la paleta amarilla de Padcolor. */
.credit-exceed-box{background:var(--pad-yellow-light);border:1.5px solid var(--pad-yellow);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin:6px 12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(244,168,0,.15)}
.credit-exceed-msg{font-size:12px;color:#7a5300;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;text-align:center}
.credit-exceed-msg strong{font-weight:800;color:#5a3a00}
.credit-exceed-figures{display:flex;gap:6px}
.credit-exceed-cell{flex:1;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--pad-yellow);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 6px;text-align:center}
.credit-exceed-label{font-size:9.5px;color:#9b6800;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.3px;margin-bottom:1px}
.credit-exceed-value{font-size:13px;color:#5a3a00;font-weight:800}
.btn-credit-action{display:block;width:100%;padding:9px;background:var(--pad-yellow);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;border-radius:7px;letter-spacing:.3px;transition:background .12s;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(244,168,0,.35)}
.btn-credit-action:hover{background:#dd9a00}
.credit-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:600}
.credit-value{font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px}

.cart-list{flex:1 0 auto;padding:8px 12px}
.cart-empty{text-align:center;padding:32px 12px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-style:italic;font-size:13px}
.cart-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200);align-items:flex-start}
.cart-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.cart-item-info{flex:1;min-width:0}
.cart-item-desc{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--pad-text);line-height:1.3;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.cart-item-meta{font-size:11px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);margin-top:2px}
.cart-item-qty{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-top:6px}
.cart-item-qty .qty-input-wrap{transform:scale(.92);transform-origin:left center}
.cart-item-price{text-align:right;min-width:80px;font-size:12px}
.cart-item-unit{color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-size:10.5px}
.cart-item-sub{font-weight:700;font-size:13px;margin-top:2px}
.cart-item-sub.noprice{font-style:italic;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-size:11px;font-weight:500}
.cart-item-remove{background:transparent;color:var(--pad-red);font-size:16px;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1}
.cart-item-remove:hover{background:var(--pad-red-light)}

.cart-footer{flex:0 0 auto;padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200);background:#fff}
.cart-min-notice{background:#fff8e1;color:#9b6800;border:1.5px solid var(--pad-yellow);border-radius:6px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:.3px}
.cart-min-notice.satisfied{background:var(--pad-green-light);color:var(--pad-green);border-color:var(--pad-green)}
.cart-total-box{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:var(--radius);text-align:center;background:var(--pad-grey-100);border:2px solid var(--pad-grey-200);transition:all .15s}
.cart-total-box.green{background:var(--pad-green-light);border-color:var(--pad-green)}
.cart-total-box.yellow{background:var(--pad-yellow-light);border-color:var(--pad-yellow)}
.cart-total-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;font-weight:700}
.cart-total-value{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--pad-text);line-height:1.1}
.cart-total-msg{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px;color:var(--pad-grey-700)}
.cart-total-box.yellow .cart-total-msg{color:#9b6800}

.btn-primary{display:block;width:100%;padding:12px;background:var(--pad-blue);color:#fff;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px;transition:background .12s}
.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--pad-blue-dark)}
.btn-primary:disabled{background:var(--pad-grey-300);cursor:not-allowed}

.btn-secondary{display:block;width:100%;padding:10px;background:var(--pad-yellow);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px;transition:background .12s}
.btn-secondary:hover{background:#dd9a00}

/* -------- Modal -------- */
.modal-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:200;padding:16px;overflow-y:auto}
.modal-overlay.show{display:flex}
.modal{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--pad-shadow-lg);max-width:560px;width:100%;max-height:90vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
.modal-wide{max-width:720px}
.modal-header{padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
.modal-body{padding:18px;overflow-y:auto;flex:1}
.modal-body p{margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--pad-grey-700);font-size:13px}
.modal-body strong{color:var(--pad-text)}
.modal-close{font-size:22px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:6px}
.modal-close:hover{background:var(--pad-grey-100)}
.modal-footer{padding:14px 18px;border-top:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200);background:var(--pad-grey-100);display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px}

.modal-page-img{max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200)}

/* -------- Credit modal (solicitud de aumento de línea) -------- */
.credit-summary{background:var(--pad-grey-100);padding:14px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
.cs-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.cs-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:600}
.cs-value{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pad-text)}
.cs-value.highlight{color:var(--pad-blue)}
.credit-section-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:18px 0 10px;color:var(--pad-text)}
.credit-section-title:first-of-type{margin-top:6px}
.credit-subtitle{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pad-grey-500);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;margin:10px 0 6px}
.credit-grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
.credit-grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
.credit-field{margin-bottom:10px}
.credit-field label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--pad-grey-700);margin-bottom:4px}
.credit-field label .req{color:var(--pad-red)}
.credit-input{width:100%;padding:8px 12px;font-size:13.5px;border:1.5px solid var(--pad-grey-200);border-radius:6px;background:#fff;font-family:inherit;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s}
.credit-input:focus{border-color:var(--pad-blue)}
.credit-input[type=file]{padding:6px 8px;font-size:12px;background:var(--pad-grey-100);cursor:pointer}
.credit-highlight-box{background:#fff8e1;border-left:3px solid var(--pad-yellow);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5}
.credit-error{color:var(--pad-red);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;margin-top:14px;min-height:18px}
.credit-buttons{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}
.credit-buttons .btn-primary{flex:2}
.credit-buttons .btn-secondary{flex:1}

/* -------- Page modal (catálogo) -------- */
.modal-page{max-width:900px}
.page-modal-info{font-size:12px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);text-align:center;margin-top:8px}

/* -------- Toast -------- */
.toast-area{position:fixed;bottom:20px;right:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;z-index:300;pointer-events:none}
.toast{background:var(--pad-text);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;box-shadow:var(--pad-shadow-lg);animation:toastIn .25s ease,toastOut .35s ease 2.6s forwards;max-width:320px}
.toast.success{background:var(--pad-green)}
.toast.error{background:var(--pad-red)}
@keyframes toastIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@keyframes toastOut{to{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-10px)}}

/* -------- Identity Card (sec. 6.5 — adaptación móvil) -------- */
.col-right{gap:10px}
.identity-card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--pad-grey-200);box-shadow:var(--pad-shadow-sm);padding:14px 16px;flex:0 0 auto}
.identity-card-header{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pad-grey-500);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.identity-card-header::before{content:'1';display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:18px;height:18px;background:var(--pad-blue);color:#fff;border-radius:50%;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}
.identity-card-chip{display:none;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:var(--pad-green-light);color:var(--pad-green);border:1.5px solid var(--pad-green);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3}
.identity-card-chip .chip-check{font-weight:900;font-size:15px;flex:0 0 auto}
.identity-card-chip .chip-text{flex:1;min-width:0;word-break:break-word}
.identity-card-chip strong{color:var(--pad-text)}
.identity-card-chip .chip-edit{background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--pad-blue);font-weight:600;font-size:12px;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;padding:2px 6px;flex:0 0 auto}
.identity-card-chip .chip-edit:hover{color:var(--pad-blue-dark)}
.identity-card.compact .identity-card-form{display:none}
.identity-card.compact .identity-card-chip{display:flex}
.banner-text-mobile{display:none}

/* -------- Responsive -------- */
@media(max-width:1100px){
  .main-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  /* Promover los hijos de col-right al main-wrap para poder intercalar el catálogo en medio */
  .col-right{display:contents;position:static;max-height:none;overflow:visible}
  .identity-card{order:-1;margin:0}
  .col-left{order:0}
  .cart-panel{order:1;max-height:none;min-height:auto}
  /* Banner: texto adaptado a la nueva disposición */
  .banner-text-desktop{display:none}
  .banner-text-mobile{display:inline}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .header-row{font-size:12px}
  .agent-box{gap:10px;width:100%}
  .ag-item{min-width:90px}
  .products-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:8px}
  .product-card{font-size:12px}
  .identity-card{padding:12px 14px}
}

/* -------- Scrollbars sutiles -------- */
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:8px;height:8px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--pad-grey-300);border-radius:4px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:var(--pad-grey-500)}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="header-row">
    <div class="logo">
      <img class="logo-mark" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="PadColor">
      <div>
        Padcolor · Pre-Pedidos
        <span class="logo-sub">Catálogo Verano 2026 · v7</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="agent-box">
      <div class="ag-item">
        <span class="ag-label">Tu agente es</span>
        <span class="ag-val ag-empty" id="ag-nombre">Captura tu núm. de cliente</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ag-item">
        <span class="ag-label">WhatsApp</span>
        <span class="ag-val ag-empty" id="ag-wa">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ag-item">
        <span class="ag-label">Correo</span>
        <span class="ag-val ag-empty" id="ag-mail">—</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="main-wrap">
  <!-- COLUMNA IZQUIERDA: SELECCIÓN DE PRODUCTOS -->
  <div class="col-left">
    <div class="panel" style="margin-bottom:12px">
      <div class="panel-body" style="padding:12px 14px">
        <div class="search-bar">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
          <input id="search-input" type="text" placeholder="Buscar por código UPC, modelo (ej. 412), descripción, serie o tamaño…" autocomplete="off">
          <button class="search-clear" id="search-clear" title="Limpiar" style="display:none">×</button>
        </div>

        <div class="filters-row">
          <div class="filter-chip" style="padding:4px 10px;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px">
            <span style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--pad-grey-700)">Página</span>
            <input id="filter-page" type="number" min="2" max="110" placeholder="—"
              style="width:64px;border:none;background:transparent;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pad-blue-dark);outline:none;text-align:center"
              inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off">
            <button id="filter-page-clear" type="button" title="Limpiar página"
              style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-size:14px;padding:0 2px;display:none">×</button>
          </div>
          <select class="filter-chip" id="filter-grupo" style="padding:6px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">
            <option value="">Grupo de temporada o productos</option>
          </select>
          <button class="filter-chip" id="chip-especial" data-filter="especial">
            $E Precio Especial
            <span class="qty" id="qty-especial">—</span>
          </button>
          <button class="filter-chip" id="chip-nuevos" data-filter="nuevos">
            ✨ Nuevos
            <span class="qty" id="qty-nuevos">—</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="results-info">
          <div class="results-count">Mostrando <strong id="count-shown">0</strong> de <strong id="count-total">0</strong> productos</div>
          <button class="filter-toggle" id="reset-filters" style="display:none">⟲ Limpiar filtros</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="price-list-banner" class="price-list-banner">
      <span class="price-list-banner-icon">ⓘ</span>
      <span id="price-list-banner-text"><span class="banner-text-desktop">Mostrando precios <strong>Lista</strong>. Captura tu número de cliente y RFC para ver tus precios.</span><span class="banner-text-mobile">Identifícate arriba ↑ para ver tus precios.</span></span>
    </div>

    <div id="products-grid" class="products-grid"></div>
    <div id="empty-state" class="empty-state" style="display:none">No se encontraron productos con los filtros actuales.</div>
    <div id="load-more" style="text-align:center;margin:14px 0;display:none">
      <button class="filter-toggle" id="btn-load-more">Cargar más productos…</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- COLUMNA DERECHA: IDENTITY CARD + CARRITO -->
  <aside class="col-right">

    <!-- Identity card: en móvil se reordena arriba del catálogo via @media + display:contents -->
    <div class="identity-card" id="identity-card">
      <div class="identity-card-form">
        <div class="identity-card-header">Identifícate primero</div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Núm. cliente <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="cli-num" class="form-input" placeholder="Ej: 102-01-00331 o XXXXX">
          <div class="form-msg" id="cli-msg"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom:0">
            <label>Nombre comercial</label>
            <input type="text" id="cli-nc" class="form-input readonly" readonly>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom:0">
            <label>RFC <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="cli-rfc" class="form-input" placeholder="RFC del cliente" maxlength="13" autocomplete="off">
            <div class="form-msg" id="rfc-msg"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="identity-card-chip">
        <span class="chip-check">✓</span>
        <span class="chip-text">Cliente <strong id="chip-num">—</strong> · <span id="chip-name">—</span> · Lista <strong id="chip-lista">—</strong></span>
        <button type="button" class="chip-edit" id="chip-edit">editar</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel cart-panel">
      <div class="panel-header">
        🛒 Carrito
        <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--pad-grey-500);font-weight:600" id="cart-count">0 productos</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cart-scroll">
      <div class="cart-form">
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Correo <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input type="email" id="cli-email" class="form-input" placeholder="cliente@correo.com">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Celular 10 dígitos <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input type="tel" id="cli-tel" class="form-input" placeholder="(XX) XXXX-XXXX" maxlength="14">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cart-list" id="cart-list">
        <div class="cart-empty">El carrito está vacío.<br>Agrega productos del catálogo →</div>
      </div>

      <div class="credit-exceed-box" id="credit-exceed-box" style="display:none">
        <div class="credit-exceed-msg">El pedido sobrepasa el límite de crédito disponible. Podemos resolverlo: <strong>Llena tu solicitud de incremento y mándala junto con tu pedido.</strong> Tramitaremos tu incremento de línea express.</div>
        <div class="credit-exceed-figures">
          <div class="credit-exceed-cell">
            <div class="credit-exceed-label">Línea de crédito</div>
            <div class="credit-exceed-value" id="cli-lc">—</div>
          </div>
          <div class="credit-exceed-cell">
            <div class="credit-exceed-label">Disponible</div>
            <div class="credit-exceed-value" id="cli-disp">—</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-credit-action" id="btn-credit">Tramita tu incremento express →</button>
      </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cart-footer">
        <div class="cart-min-notice" id="cart-min-notice">Pedido mínimo $7,000</div>
        <div class="cart-total-box" id="total-box">
          <div class="cart-total-label">Total con IVA</div>
          <div class="cart-total-value" id="total-value">$0.00</div>
          <div class="cart-total-msg" id="total-msg"></div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-primary" id="btn-finalize" disabled>Finalizar pre-pedido</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>
</main>

<!-- Modal genérico -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal">
  <div class="modal" id="modal-content">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <span id="modal-title">Mensaje</span>
      <button class="modal-close" data-close>×</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body" id="modal-body"></div>
    <div class="modal-footer" id="modal-footer">
      <button class="filter-toggle" data-close>Cerrar</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Toast area -->
<div class="toast-area" id="toast-area"></div>

